# Ladder rungs gated in CI for the ipu6 variant of the QEMU model
# (IPU4_VARIANT=ipu6; plan "Parallel track" in
# tools/notes/ipu6-ipu4-plan.md). Same format as enabled-tests (the ipu4
# list): one rung name per line, '#' starts a comment. The variant leg
# shows that the IPU4 series does not break plain IPU6; each parallel-
# track PR enables one more rung here.

# Static rungs: variant-independent, same result as the ipu4 leg.
series-applies
build
checkpatch
